This mod was written from scratch. It does not contain code copied from the projects below.

It is made to run with, and reads files written by the setup of:
  - Dauntless Forever (https://github.com/addison2k/DauntlessForever), AGPL-3.0, Copyright (C) 2026 Addison2k.
    healthbar writes its small data file into the same meter folder (DF_METER_DIR) that the bundled
    DamageMeter mod uses.
  - UE4SS (https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS), MIT licence. It is the Lua mod loader this runs on.

"Dauntless" and related names belong to their owners. They are used here only to say what this mod works with.
